To build GdbRiscV64Plugin on RV64g linux
## Tested on StartFive VisionFive V2 w Debian Linux

@@ ToDo: reduce/simplify gdb build components
@@ sudo alt-get install ???

cd gdb-18.1/zib # i.e. processors/RiscV64/gdb-18.1/zlib
./configure
make COG=1

cd gdb-18.1/libsframe # i.e. processors/RiscV64/gdb-18.1/libsframe
./configure --target=riscv64-unknown-linux-gnu
make COG=1

cd gdb-18.1/bfd # i.e. processors/RiscV64/gdb-18.1/bfd
./configure --target=riscv64-unknown-linux-gnu --with-system-zlib=no
make COG=1

cd gdb-18.1/libiberty # i.e. processors/RiscV64/gdb-18.1/libiberty
./configure --target=riscv64-unknown-linux-gnu
make COG=1

As above for subdirs
   opcodes
   readline
   gnulib
   sim

That should produce processors/RiscV64/gdb-18.1/sim/riscv/libsim.a
With that built you can configure and build VMs that will build
the GdbRiscV64Plugin plugin.

See platforms/unix/plugins/GdbRiscV64Plugin/HowToBuild

